  "name": "TestOuterErrorVarVisibleAfterInnerHandlerCloses",
  "comment": "After the inner on.error scope closes, the outer recovery body's %!error% restores to the outer caught error via LIFO AsyncLocal scope. Reuses OuterRecoveryWithInnerThrow which sets %outerSeenAfterInner% AFTER its inner handler closes.",
